From 350f3ec6dd7c65994a7d7f079187a0ba66bfdf06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 02:06:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Menu and tool-strip captions: an ampersand marks a mnemonic,
 it is not text

ToolStripMenuItem (menu bar, submenus, context menus), ToolStripButton, ToolStripLabel,
ToolStripStatusLabel, ToolStripDropDownButton and ToolStripSplitButton showed '&' literally.
Their caption labels now use Mnemonics.ToGtk with UseUnderline and the item's button as
mnemonic widget; Text still reads back as written, so tray menus keep working.
---
 .../Windows/Forms/MnemonicFunctionalTests.cs  | Bin 3791 -> 8735 bytes
 .../Forms/MenuStripBase/StripMenuItem.cs      |  15 ++++++++++++---
 .../MenuStripBase/StripMenuToolButton.cs      |  13 +++++++++++--
 .../Forms/MenuStripBase/StripToolButton.cs    |  13 +++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

